      "value": "@{5b21785df50cde783626bd94|full_name}: the functions are similar sure, but only if the pickup (in the way i described it, if you only read the title you won't know what i mean) is put directly onto the avatar (in the case that the script is made this way, if at all), but if it were made as i described above then you would be able to put it on, for example, a sword or something and then you could grab it from your hip or back and not have to use up a gesture, then have it zip back to your hip, back, etc, when you let go of it (sorta like the microphone in the great pug). i understand what you're getting at, that there's already a way to pick people up and all that with seats, but it seems to me that, as i already said, you just read the title and blindly judged my request without even bothering to read my post at all. sorry i stretched this reply out too long, but jeez man, just pay attention to what you're judging before you well... judge it... oof now it's even longer, sorry if i'm being too rash or defensive with this response, i just really like this idea, if i'm offending you in any way i sincerely apologise, i hope you have a good day, sorry this response is repetitive and literally longer than the post itself and i hope i'm not causing an argument over a small piece of negative feedback... again... (*v .) please read the post if you haven't.",
