      "value": "@{5c2832a7c19b437a1ca1f38f|full_name}: nah you're good, and I think I'm understanding something about the thing you're talking about.\n\nI've just recently learned about a thing called Final-IK\n\nbasically, you can dynamically re-parent objects, like seats or guns, and in a sense, there's one gesture to grab the object in question. the nearest point it can attach to (such as the hip or shoulder) it will go there and stay there without taking up more gestures.",
