  "details": "just wondering if you guys could possibly consider allowing the vrc_pickup on avatars or maybe making an avatar variant of the script with options like ither anybody being able to pick you up, only friends or only you, i think this would be an awesome feature, plus it could also be used on singular objects on the avatar so you could say for example have a sword or something on your hip then you could grab it without the need of a gesture and have an option allowing it to zip back to your hip once you drop it. it's fine by me what you do with this but i personally would love this feature to death. thank you for reading this long, boring string of text and have a good day, look forward to seeing what you think! \\(^o^)/",
